OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer thrown from speeding car
OL,4,Agiven award after returning to work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer who suffered life
OL,7,Fchanging injuries when he was thrown
OL,8,Ffrom a speeding car has described the
OL,9,F"terrifying" moment he returned to
OL,10,Fduty, after two years of recovery and
OL,11,Ftreatment.
OL,13,FPC Mark Smith was certain he was going
OL,14,Fto die when two men attempted to murder
OL,15,Fhim in South Lanarkshire in 2024.
OL,17,FThe 35-year-old has now received an
OL,18,Faward from the Scottish Police
OL,19,FFederation in recognition of his
OL,20,Fresilience and determination to rebuild
OL,21,Fhis life and career.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
